config UPSA_HISTORY
    bool "Long history (a reading every 10 s, about 28 days, kept on flash)"
    depends on UPSA_OUTAGE_LOG
    default y
    help
        Keeps a reading of the UPS every ten seconds in the outagelog
        partition beyond the outage records, about 28 days of them, across
        restarts and updates, for the web page's chart (1 hour to 30 days).
        Rev B only. See components/history.
